msgstr "Status"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-auto-test.php:175
#: includes/ingeniero/class-seo-ingeniero-admin.php:823
msgid "Detalle"
msgstr "Details"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-auto-test.php:183
msgid ""
"El resultado es puntual, no se guarda. La conexión real de proveedores se "
"prueba por separado desde Connections y puede consumir recursos del servicio"
" externo."
msgstr "The result is temporary and is not saved. Real provider connectivity is tested separately in Connections and may use external service resources."

