#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:27
msgid "1. Acceso y navegación"
msgstr "1. Access and navigation"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:32
msgid "2. Connections: proveedores externos"
msgstr "2. Connections: external providers"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:34
msgid "La cadena de búsqueda sigue el orden"
msgstr "The search sequence follows this order"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:34
#: includes/ingeniero/class-seo-ingeniero-admin.php:487
msgid "SerpApi → ScraperAPI"
msgstr "SerpApi → ScraperAPI"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:34
msgid ""
". Un resultado válido sin coincidencias no es un fallo ni obliga a cambiar "
"de proveedor. Ajusta el límite mensual local de SerpApi según tu contrato. "
"Las cifras de peticiones locales no sustituyen la facturación oficial de los"
" proveedores."
msgstr ". A valid response with no matches is not a failure and does not require switching providers. Set the local monthly SerpApi limit according to your contract. Local request counts do not replace official provider billing."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:35
msgid "El botón"
msgstr "The button"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:35
msgid "Probar cadena"
msgstr "Test provider chain"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:35
msgid ""
"es una comprobación real de conexión: SerpApi utiliza su consulta de cuenta;"
" si necesita pasar a ScraperAPI puede consumir una solicitud externa. No "
"confundir esta acción con Autotest."
msgstr "is a real connection test: SerpApi uses its account endpoint; if it must fall back to ScraperAPI, it may consume an external request. Do not confuse this action with the self-test."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:37
msgid "3. Ojeador: mercado y precios"
msgstr "3. Ojeador: market and prices"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:40
msgid "Análisis y recomendaciones:"
msgstr "Analysis and recommendations:"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:40
msgid ""
"indicadores por categoría, oportunidades comerciales, bloqueo operativo y "
"comercios representados en la muestra."
msgstr "category indicators, commercial opportunities, operational blocks and merchants represented in the sample."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:41
msgid "Posición de precio:"
msgstr "Price position:"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:41
msgid ""
"compara tu producto con el rango de mercado; permite filtrar por categoría, "
"proveedor y visibilidad."
msgstr "compares your product against the market price range; filters by category, supplier and visibility."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:42
msgid "Comparador de productos:"
msgstr "Product comparison:"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:42
msgid ""
"resultados de Shopping por precio, comercio, marca/modelo, descuento y "
"valoraciones."
msgstr "Shopping results by price, merchant, brand/model, discount and ratings."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:43
msgid "Operación y consultas:"
msgstr "Operations and requests:"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:43
msgid ""
"categorías aptas, cobertura, estado de cada consulta y registro de "
"peticiones; aquí se ajusta el ritmo del servicio."
msgstr "eligible categories, coverage, query status and request log; adjust the service rate here."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:44
msgid "Merchant · Comparación gratuita:"
msgstr "Merchant · Free comparison:"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:44
msgid ""
"consulta los datos Merchant disponibles sin sustituir el histórico de "
"Shopping."
msgstr "view the available Merchant data without replacing historical Shopping results."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:46
msgid "Continuar / actualizar mercado"
msgstr "Continue / refresh market"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:46
msgid "inicia un recorrido por categorías aptas y"
msgstr "starts a scan of eligible categories and"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:46
msgid "Detener"
msgstr "Stop"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:46
msgid ""
"permite parar el proceso. El trabajo se realiza por lotes mediante WP-Cron. "
"Ajusta las categorías por paso, la frecuencia y la reutilización de "
"consultas antes de aumentar el ritmo. La lectura de informes no modifica "
"productos ni precios de venta."
msgstr "allows the process to be stopped. Work runs in batches via WP-Cron. Adjust categories per step, frequency and query reuse before increasing the rate. Viewing reports does not change products or sale prices."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:47
msgid ""
"Utiliza las exportaciones JSON existentes para conservar resultados y "
"trazabilidad. Revisa fecha, cobertura y fuentes antes de tomar decisiones "
"comerciales."
msgstr "Use the existing JSON exports to retain results and traceability. Check dates, coverage and sources before making commercial decisions."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:49
msgid "4. Ingeniero: investigación técnica y editorial"
msgstr "4. Ingeniero: technical and editorial research"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:51
msgid "La interfaz incluye"
msgstr "The interface includes"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:51
msgid "Investigación"
msgstr "Research"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:51
msgid "Editorial"
msgstr "Editorial"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:51
msgid "Posts"
msgstr "Posts"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:51
msgid "Landings"
msgstr "Landing pages"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:51
msgid "Radar externo"
msgstr "External radar"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:51
#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:53
#: includes/ingeniero/class-seo-ingeniero-admin.php:802
msgid "Datos y fuentes"
msgstr "Data and sources"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:51
#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:53
msgid "Pruebas"
msgstr "Tests"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:51
msgid ""
". Algunas vistas editoriales dependen de los módulos especializados "
"disponibles en la instalación."
msgstr ". Some editorial views depend on specialist modules available on the installation."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:52
msgid ""
"Para trabajar: selecciona las categorías y la capa, configura las búsquedas "
"por categoría, recopila las fuentes, revisa evidencias y confianza, y "
"utiliza los controles de revisión y aprobación antes de aceptar propuestas o"
" generar borradores. La investigación por sí sola no publica contenidos."
msgstr "Workflow: select categories and the layer, configure per-category searches, collect sources, review evidence and confidence, and use review and approval controls before accepting proposals or creating drafts. Research alone does not publish content."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:53
msgid "permite consultar la información conservada;"
msgstr "allows you to view retained information;"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:53
msgid ""
"contiene comprobaciones propias del proceso editorial, distintas del "
"Autotest general de Scrappers."
msgstr "contains editorial workflow checks separate from the general Scrappers self-test."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:55
msgid "5. Autotest y resultados"
msgstr "5. Self-test and results"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:57
msgid "Una clave API pendiente de configurar aparece como"
msgstr "An API key awaiting configuration appears as"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:57
msgid "Aviso"
msgstr "Notice"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:57
msgid ""
"y no como error de programación. Si falta una tabla o un controlador, "
"consulta el bloque técnico y comprueba la instalación antes de ejecutar "
"servicios."
msgstr "and not as a programming error. If a table or controller is missing, consult the technical section and check the installation before running services."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:60
msgid "6. Estructura y ciclo de carga"
msgstr "6. Structure and loading lifecycle"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:64
msgid "7. Persistencia y compatibilidad"
msgstr "7. Persistence and compatibility"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:69
msgid "8. Procesos programados y seguridad"
msgstr "8. Scheduled jobs and security"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:73
msgid "9. Validación, despliegue y límites"
msgstr "9. Validation, deployment and limits"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:74
msgid ""
"El autotest interno verifica carga, clases, opciones disponibles, hooks y "
"existencia de tablas, pero"
msgstr "The internal self-test checks loading, classes, available options, hooks and the existence of tables, but"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:74
msgid "no acredita"
msgstr "does not validate"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:74
msgid ""
"acceso HTTP real, calidad de fuentes, ejecución de cron ni resultados "
"comerciales. Para esto, utiliza el test explícito de Connections, los logs "
"de Ojeador, las pruebas editoriales de Ingeniero y los controles de tareas "
"programadas de WordPress."
msgstr "real HTTP access, source quality, cron execution or commercial results. For these, use the explicit Connections test, Ojeador logs, Ingeniero editorial tests and the WordPress scheduled-task controls."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:77
msgid "Diagnóstico y resolución de incidencias"
msgstr "Diagnostics and troubleshooting"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:78
msgid "10. Problemas frecuentes"
msgstr "10. Common problems"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:80
msgid "Sin clave de proveedor:"
msgstr "Missing provider key:"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:80
msgid ""
"revisa Connections; el autotest señalará la configuración ausente sin "
"mostrar credenciales."
msgstr "check Connections; the self-test flags missing configuration without exposing credentials."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:81
msgid "Sin resultados de Shopping:"
msgstr "No Shopping results:"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:81
msgid ""
"distingue respuesta válida de cero resultados, límite de cuota, problemas de"
" red y categoría no apta; revisa Operación y consultas."
msgstr "distinguish a valid response with zero results from a quota limit, network issues or an ineligible category; check Operations and queries."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:82
msgid "Un proceso no avanza:"
msgstr "A process is not progressing:"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:82
msgid ""
"comprueba WP-Cron, la cola programada, el estado de bloqueo y la "
"disponibilidad del proveedor; no fuerces llamadas repetidas sin comprobar "
"consumo."
msgstr "check WP-Cron, the scheduled queue, lock status and provider availability; do not force repeated calls before checking consumption."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:83
msgid "Faltan tablas:"
msgstr "Missing tables:"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:83
msgid ""
"verifica versión y activación, la instalación previa de Ojeador/Ingeniero y "
"la migración. El Autotest no crea ni modifica tablas."
msgstr "check version and activation, the previous Ojeador/Ingeniero installation and migration. The self-test does not create or change tables."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:84
msgid "Ingeniero sin propuestas:"
msgstr "Ingeniero has no proposals:"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:84
msgid ""
"comprueba cobertura de categorías, fuentes, conocimiento aprobado y acciones"
" editoriales; ausencia de resultados no equivale a error técnico."
msgstr "check category coverage, sources, approved knowledge and editorial actions; no results does not imply a technical error."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:85
msgid "Coexistencia con monolito:"
msgstr "Coexistence with the monolith:"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:85
msgid ""
"comprueba cuál registra los handlers y hooks. Las clases con nombres "
"heredados se reutilizan para evitar redeclaraciones."
msgstr "check which one registers handlers and hooks. Legacy class names are reused to avoid redeclarations."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-scrappers-manual.php:87
msgid "Volver al índice"
msgstr "Back to contents"

